# A file that affects the dependencies, the licences, a tool version or the build inputs needs an owner's review.
# See the approval procedure in CONTRIBUTING.md.
#
# The list below has to hold every path that can change "what gets compiled".
# Guarding Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock alone still leaves .cargo/config.toml's source replacement, or vendor/,
# able to compile a different source under the same name and version (xtask audit's stage 0 refuses that
# mechanically too, but the review is needed separately).
Cargo.toml             @shim9610
**/Cargo.toml          @shim9610
Cargo.lock             @shim9610
deps.allow             @shim9610
deny.toml              @shim9610
rust-toolchain.toml    @shim9610
xtask/tools.lock       @shim9610
xtask/**               @shim9610
.cargo/**              @shim9610
vendor/**              @shim9610
.github/**             @shim9610
**/build.rs            @shim9610
assets/**/LICENSE-*    @shim9610
THIRD_PARTY.md         @shim9610
